const privacyPolicyContent = `<p>This Privacy Policy (â€œPolicyâ€) explains how Credorbit Technologies Private Limited (â€œCredOrbitâ€, â€œweâ€, â€œusâ€, or â€œourâ€) collects, uses, stores, shares, and protects your information when you visit our website [https://www.credorbit.com] (â€œWebsiteâ€) or use any of our services, including products, platforms, tools, features, or solutions offered through the Website (collectively referred to as â€œServicesâ€).</p><p><br></p><p>By accessing or using our Services, you acknowledge and accept the practices and policies described in this Policy and agree to our collection, use, and disclosure of your information as described herein.</p><p><br></p><p>1. Information We Collect</p><p><br></p><p>We collect the following categories of personal information (â€œPersonal Informationâ€) either directly from you, from public sources, or from third-party partners:</p><p><br></p><p>A. Information You Provide</p><p><br></p><p>Name</p><p>Mobile number</p><p>Email address</p><p>PAN, Aadhaar, or KYC documents</p><p>Address and contact details</p><p>Employment and income information</p><p>Bank account or payment details</p><p>Loan application or credit request details</p><p>Any other information voluntarily provided during account creation, onboarding, or availing services</p><p><br></p><p>B. Information Automatically Collected</p><p><br></p><p>IP address</p><p>Device information (browser, OS, device type)</p><p>Date and time of access</p><p>Location data (subject to permissions)</p><p>Usage behavior on the Website (clicks, pages visited, time spent, etc.)</p><p>Cookies and similar technologies (see Section 6)</p><p><br></p><p>2. How We Use Your Information</p><p><br></p><p>We use your information for the following purposes:</p><p><br></p><p>To verify your identity and conduct KYC</p><p><p>To process your loan or credit applications</p><p>To assess eligibility and creditworthiness</p><p>To enable onboarding with our partner institutions</p><p>To communicate with you (e.g., updates, offers, transaction alerts)</p><p>To provide, maintain, and improve our Website and Services</p><p>To personalize your experience on the Website</p><p>To comply with applicable legal obligations</p><p>To prevent fraud, enforce terms, and ensure platform security</p><p>For analytics, research, and product development</p><p><br></p><p>3. Disclosure of Your Information</p><p><br></p><p>We may share your Personal Information with lending partners, vendors, regulators, affiliates, and prospective buyers where needed to deliver services or comply with law.</p><p><br></p><p>4. Your Rights</p><p><br></p><p>You may request access, correction, deletion, consent withdrawal, and grievance redressal subject to applicable law.</p><p><br></p><p>5. Data Retention</p><p><br></p><p>We retain your information for as long as necessary to fulfill the purposes stated in this Policy, or as required by applicable law, regulatory requirements, or contractual obligations.</p><p><br></p><p>6. Cookies and Tracking Technologies</p><p><br></p><p>We use cookies and similar tracking technologies to enhance your experience, analyze usage, and deliver relevant content.</p><p><br></p><p>7. Data Security</p><p><br></p><p>We implement appropriate technical and organizational measures including SSL, access controls, and regular assessments.</p><p><br></p><p>8. Childrenâ€™s Privacy</p><p><br></p><p>Our Website is not intended for individuals under the age of 18.</p><p><br></p><p>9. Grievance Redressal</p><p><br></p><p>Grievance Officer</p><p>Name: Dhrumit Parikh</p><p>Email: dhrumit@msaca.co.in</p><p>Phone: +91 95375 45851</p><p>Address: A/5, Fifth Floor, Safal Profitaire, Corporate Road, Prahladnagar, Ahmedabad-380015</p><p>Working Hours: Monday â€“ Friday (10:00 AM â€“ 6:00 PM)</p><p>You can expect a response within 7 working days.</p><p><br></p><p>10. Legal Basis and Jurisdiction</p><p><br></p><p>This Policy is governed by the laws of India. Any disputes shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of courts in Ahmedabad, Gujarat, unless otherwise agreed.</p><p><br></p><p>11. Changes to This Policy</p><p><br></p><p>We may update this Policy from time to time.</p><p><br></p><p>12. Consent</p><p><br></p><p>By accessing or using the Website, you consent to the collection, use, processing, storage, and disclosure of your information in accordance with this Privacy Policy.</p><h1 class="ql-indent-1">Test Test</h1>`;

